task_spec.prompt:
Implement Point and Rectangle as @dataclass types in src/shapes.py.

from dataclasses import dataclass


@dataclass
class Point:
    x: float
    y: float


@dataclass
class Rectangle:
    x: float
    y: float
    width: float
    height: float


def area(rect: Rectangle) -> float:
    return rect.width * rect.height


def translate(point: Point, dx: float, dy: float) -> Point:
    return Point(point.x + dx, point.y + dy)

All 5 tests must pass.
Run: uv run pytest tests/ -v
